  "created": "2026-08-26T04:15:04.39Z",
  "description": "A fully managed imaging library for .NET: PNG, JPEG (incl. progressive and CMYK), WebP, GIF, BMP, TIFF, TGA, Netpbm, QOI and ICO codecs, an Image<TPixel> processing pipeline (resize, crop, rotate, blur/sharpen, thresholding incl. Otsu/Sauvola/Bradley, deskew) and image-to-tensor bridges for ONNX and other ML runtimes. AOT and trimming friendly.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "EasyImageSharp",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-26T04:17:38.223Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "NZ7sEi74efjQR8evGEFFi5njZdVhuYxFT4vfiAOozISd7FZVMrqSijn0LDcJhUAqtN3lkVJV/gy3bs4MQ2uKGg==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 1324765,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/FarhanLodi/EasyImageSharp",
  "published": "2026-08-26T04:15:04.39Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1: documentation only — no library code changed and the package icon is unchanged. The README header logo is now constrained to 128x128, and the README no longer claims verification that is no longer performed. 1.0.0: first stable release. Ten codecs (PNG, JPEG incl. progressive and CMYK, WebP incl. lossy/lossless/animated encode and decode, GIF, BMP, TIFF incl. CCITT G3/G4 and JPEG-in-TIFF, TGA, Netpbm, QOI, ICO/CUR); EXIF/ICC/XMP metadata with AutoOrient; high-precision pixel formats; affine and projective transforms with 15 resamplers; colour matrices, convolution, blend modes and CLAHE; quantisation and dithering; a document-imaging toolkit (Sauvola/Niblack/Wolf/NICK, morphology, connected components, deskew, page detection and perspective correction, line and word segmentation); annotation drawing with an embedded bitmap font; DecoderOptions resource limits with a closed exception contract; and a SIMD and parallelism pass (JPEG decode 4.7x faster, resize up to 15x, up to 25x fewer allocations). See CHANGELOG.md.",
